  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Info</name><text>This scaffold detail view focuses on the RPU family. The live differential-current rows below are IOC-side calc records derived from adjacent device current readbacks so we can review the operator flow before the final hardware behavior is defined.</text><x>20</x><y>56</y><width>860</width><height>52</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><actions></actions></widget>
