  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Foot</name><text>The IOC now provides these pairwise differential-current PVs directly so later Phoebus plots or alarm logic can bind to stable names instead of display-local formulas. Waveform PVs still exist per device as WFM_RBV, but a live trend/plot needs a defined X-axis or history source.</text><x>20</x><y>710</y><width>1240</width><height>42</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><actions></actions></widget>
